# Deliver work

Use `orchestration_apply name=METHOD task="the contribution"` for a needed procedure. `specialist` supplies the shared execution method; `implementer` adds code realization; `integrator` combines candidates; `release` prepares the assigned publication materials.

Preserve assignment identity, source intent, functional context and the active specification mode. Continue related local steps in this context. Use a continued ACP episode for separately recorded related work. Obtain expertise through the Facilitator. Request separate execution for a contribution whose parallelism, independence or isolation benefits the result.
